1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,268
A thermopile is astonishingly sensitive.

2
00:00:03,268 --> 00:00:08,867
It can register the warmth of a person standing a few metres away, or of the Moon.

3
00:00:08,867 --> 00:00:17,083
It is used to measure radiant heat, in radiation pyrometers for furnaces, in infrared detectors and burglar alarms.

4
00:00:17,083 --> 00:00:22,174
Run the Peltier way, the same kind of device makes portable coolers.

5
00:00:22,174 --> 00:00:28,828
And thermoelectric generators, heated by plutonium, power deep space probes like Voyager.

